# DIT-OS build system, scripts and CI

Before editing matching files, read `.agents/skills/build-system/SKILL.md` and follow
it. Also apply `AGENTS.md` (definition of done, handoff, hard rules) and the
mandatory `.agents/skills/security-audit/SKILL.md` for every code change.
Content lives in the skill; this file only points to it.

Never forget:
- Never remove -Werror, -mgeneral-regs-only or -march=i686.
- List sources explicitly; never glob.
- Shell scripts: set -euo pipefail, quoted expansions, shellcheck clean.
